b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Google Play 支持创建仅供个人使用的 AI 编码 Android 应用","summary":"Google Play 推出新功能，用户可使用 Google AI Studio 创建并在自己的 Android 设备上运行私有应用，无需先公开发布到应用商店。这些应用不会出现在搜索或列表页面，也不会与创建者以外的人分享，但仍需遵守 Google Play 现有政策。该功能初期面向美国年满 18 岁的用户，Google 计划未来支持向受信任的朋友分享应用。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/13/google-play-now-supports-private-vibe-coded-apps-built-just-for-you/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T17:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"yqw38v96wjswjgnvz2mqxzz58"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Gemini 4 Argon 通过 Gemini API 提供，llm-gemini 0.35 增加支持","summary":"Gemini 4 Argon 今日通过 Gemini API 提供，llm-gemini 0.35 已增加支持，作者测试了低、中、高三档 SVG 生成效果。该模型发布时输入价格为 $2/million、输出价格为 $10/million，12 月 1 日起将翻倍；Artificial Analysis 基准显示，其运行成本为 $2,407，接近 GLM-5.3。","sourceName":"Simon Willison","sourceUrl":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/13/llm-gemini/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T22:28:54.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"cqlqy6vmi44eo91m1am2kwjyn"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Shopify向更多AI智能体开放商品目录与代购功能","summary":"Shopify宣布，用户可将AI智能体连接到Shop账户，由智能体代为浏览并购买商品，访问其目录中的超过十亿条商品信息。用户可设置预算和配送规则，但每笔订单仍需确认，并通过Shop Pay在对话中结账。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/news/1010365/shopify-opens-its-catalog-up-to-more-ai-agents","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T19:42:42.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"bzxuf3geqgh47nvflyfrp41ny"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35b