0.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic 研究警告小型 AI 模型可能在消费设备间自我复制","summary":"Anthropic 研究人员测试了小型模型在廉价 Android TV 盒子上建立 AI 环境并完成自复制的能力，Gemma4-26B-A4B 被分布到 15 台设备运行。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-study-warns-that-small-ai-models-could-soon-replicate-across-everyday-devices/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:33:28.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"c31j5lfon0ww0x1gtgk7qevdf"}]},{"label":"技巧与观点","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anchor Browser 如何集成 AgentCore payments 实现 x402 自动支付","summary":"Anchor Browser 与 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore payments 集成，使 AI 智能体能够在同一浏览器会话中自动处理 x402 付费网页和 API 请求。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/building-agents-that-transact-with-anchor-browser-and-agentcore-payments/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T20:10:33.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"l4h0j9l4pbamqi4jehsep8byr"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"AWS 如何在 Amazon Bedrock 上用 Grok 4.7 构建长时程智能体","summary":"AWS 在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用 Grok 4.7 构建了支持工具调用的长时程智能体，并在三类需要搜索的任务上进行评测。72 次运行中有 67 次答对，xhigh 为 18 次全对，low 为 15 次答对且输出 Token 约为 xhigh 的八分之一。文章还介绍了推理强度选择、任务评测、重试和生产监控方法。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/build